+# Feature previews
+
+universal-editor.html/tsx uses local map fixtures and the actual editor. Other preview builds are generated by scripts/build-*.mjs.
+
+## How to edit
+
+Run the app Vite server and open the relevant preview path. The road kit virtual bundle needs its dedicated build script. For full gameplay, start Rust. Preview source must use the same store/document/render modules as the app.
